        "TileImage": "$($repository c7c9e213-16f9-4215-bf07-dd8f801ce3e0).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, Agent 17. Since you have completed your contracts in the USA, today you are heading to India, to Mumbai. Your target is a true Indian legend, Vazir Kale, or the Whirlwind, as well as his beloved, Neha. The client is one of the few enemies of the Whirlwind who managed to survive the massacre he unleashed, and therefore he wants the Whirlwind to die a painful death from poisoning, and for the person closest to him to be eliminated quickly, as an unwanted witness. Good luck, Agent 17.",
